m:out-out-transition-urgent
    a owl:NamedIndividual , re:Determination ;
    re:outputTier 0 ;
    re:outputConfidence 0 ;
    re:prescribesAction re:UrgentIntervention ;
    re:actionNarrative "Physician or NP assessment within 24 hours. Investigate cause of rapid decline: new diagnosis, medication change, acute illness, environmental disruption, significant loss event. If clinical cause identified and reversible in current setting: treat in place and re-assess at next cycle. If cause requires higher level of care: activate CareTransitionWorkflow planned or emergency transition. Do not wait for Sequence 3 two-cycle confirmation — TRANSITION_URGENT is the velocity-triggered parallel path." .

